Description:It is your first main phase. You control three Treasure tokens and a tapped Darksteel Citadel, with no mana floating, and have Myr Enforcer ({7}, affinity for artifacts) in hand. Get Myr Enforcer onto the battlefield this turn.
Rule:authored-affinity-then-sacrifice-treasure | The total cost is locked in before mana abilities are activated to pay it (CR 601.2f-h): four artifacts make Enforcer cost {3}, then the three Treasures are sacrificed for the mana; sacrificing even one Treasure first raises the cost above the mana left
